69	### `traces/payload-vectors.json`
70	
71	71 vectors (13 selection, 9 bytes, 23 correlation, 26 companions), plus 29 decoder vectors, 10 encoder vectors, 4 exchange controls, 3 explanatory controls and 2 kit vector cross-checks.
72	
73	- **Negotiated vs unnegotiated** (TS and Rust each):
74	  - admitted: V3 with the token; V2 without it (occupancy omitted, nothing buffered); V3 with empty companions;
75	  - V3 without the token refuses `UNNEGOTIATED_V3`, as does V2 plus `schemaVersion`;
76	  - V2 with the token refuses `SCHEMA`;
77	  - a FactBatchV1-shaped TS payload refuses `cb24.FACT_BATCH_V2_SCHEMA` (A-s42v3-1);
78	  - exchange controls: Hello-only or HelloAck-only token faults at HelloAck; both or neither passes with `identityNegotiated` true.
79	- **Exact bytes:**
80	  - both fact-plane vectors re-encode byte-equal and decode equal, and the kit candidates admit as V3 candidate items;
81	  - hand-assembled bytes equal the encoder;
